<title>JAPAN: Hokkaido Coca-Cola -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hokkaido Coca-Cola -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 35.42		vs	   35.41</p>
<p> Operating	    2.76		vs	    2.63</p>
<p> Current		2.85		vs	    2.66</p>
<p> Net	   loss 138    million	  vs     prft 1.46</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 3.50 yen	  vs    prft 36.96 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     40 million	  vs	  40 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.50 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Hokkaido Coca-Cola Bottling Co Ltd is a Coca-Cola bottler operating in Hokkaido.</p>
</text>
